  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "The Secret Crane Princess Who Returns A Favor",
      "effect": "During your opponent's End Phase: You can place this card from your GY on top of the Deck. During the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can return this card from the field to the hand, and if you do, each player draws 1 card, then your opponent can draw 1 card, and if they do, you must keep your hand revealed during this Main Phase. (Quick Effect): You can banish this revealed card from your hand; destroy all face-up cards your opponent controls. You can only use each effect of \"The Secret Crane Princess Who Returns A Favor\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
